        "title": "An outcome achieved with difficulty",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Both expressions can describe a hard-won result in this context. Do not interpret the shorter form as saying the task was easy, or treat the first word as an ordinary adjective meaning good.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我好不容易才找到这本书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ hǎo bù róngyì cái zhǎodào zhè běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "I found this book only after considerable difficulty.",
                "audio": "560c4f62663360ffb4c50e5a8b7918f4fe6809bef84342f831de7e60ea2e0a66"
